{"id":"otnositel_no","lemma":"относительно","pos":"adv","rank":1565,"glosses":["relatively (proportionally)","rather","concerning, regarding, with respect to, as regards"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/18/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это относительно рано.","en":"It's relatively early.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"early"}]},{"text":"Всё в жизни относительно.","en":"Everything in life is relative.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"life","l":"жизнь"},null]},{"text":"Это было относительно недавно.","en":"It was relatively recently.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"recently"}]},{"text":"Это относительно легко сделать.","en":"That's relatively easy to do.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"lightly"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Я уже чувствую себя лучше относительно этого.","en":"I already feel better about that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"to feel","l":"чувствовать"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"rather, would better )"},null,null]}]}